Then the semi-cosimplicial graded abelian group is of the form
\[
C(l)^\bullet_{2k} =
\Big(
\xymatrix{
(M_k)_{\mathbb{Z}_p}
\ar@<.5ex>[r]|(.4){d_0}
\ar@<-.5ex>[r]|(.4){d_1}
&
*{
\begin{array}{c}
M_k(\Gamma_0 (l))_{\mathbb{Z}_p}\\
\times\\
(M_k)_{\mathbb{Z}_p}
\end{array}
}
\ar@<1ex>[r]
\ar[r]
\ar@<-1ex>[r]
&
M_k(\Gamma_0 (l))_{\mathbb{Z}_p}
}
